+in every dart of a family (bo2.Arm.inner_vertex), then lambda_2(Q) <= lambda_2(Q_in) for every dart Q of the family.
+p2_cert(A, C, E, k) certifies lambda_2(Q_in) < (5/2) E (Schur test of K2 - (5/2) E M2 < 0)."""
+import numpy as np
